Apply in addition: arquitectura-repo, comandos-y-entorno, auth-admin-middleware, zonas-criticas-y-validacion (in .cursor/rules).

Always inspect the full flow before changing code:
frontend page/component -> API client -> route/server action -> auth/middleware -> database.

For bugs in dashboard/admin/auth:
check shared auth/session/role logic before editing individual pages.

Before saying a flow works end-to-end, verify:
1. creation/submission
2. persistence in database
3. API response
4. UI rendering
5. role/permission behavior
6. status transitions
7. final visible result
